category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUCHIGAMI SEIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ICHIDA KAORU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>JAPAN TOBACCO INC</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUCHIGAMI, SEIJI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ICHIDA, KAORU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>JAPAN TOBACCO INC.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUCHIGAMI SEIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ICHIDA KAORU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUCHIGAMI, SEIJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ICHIDA, KAORU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A ventilation characteristic measuring device, comprising a ventilation container (401) comprising first, second, and third cylindrical containers (430, 440, 450) which are fitted air-tight and detachably from each other and a lifting device (460) which raises and lowers the third cylindrical container relative to the first and second cylindrical containers, wherein three sealed compartments are formed by the first, second, and third cylindrical containers and a specimen holding member (472) of a specimen holding device (470) installed on each of these containers and, when a first sealed compartment for cigarettes on the filter side is vented, the ventilation characteristic of cigarette is measured based on the flow rate of air flowing into a filter arranged in the second sealed chamber and each of the cigarettes arranged in the third sealed chamber.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>On décrit un dispositif de mesure de caractéristiques d'aération, qui comprend une chambre d'aération (401) incluant un premier, un deuxième et un troisième compartiments cylindriques (430, 440, 450) hermétiques pouvant être séparés les uns des autres, et un dispositif de levage (460) qui relève ou abaisse le troisième compartiment cylindrique relativement aux premier et deuxième compartiments. Ces trois compartiments hermétiques sont formés desdits premier, deuxième et troisième compartiments cylindriques et d'un élément de support d'échantillons (472) compris dans un dispositif de support d'échantillons (470) installé sur chaque compartiment. Lorsqu'un premier compartiment hermétique pour cigarettes est ventilé côté filtre, les caractéristiques d'aération des cigarettes sont mesurées sur la base du débit d'air s'écoulant à l'intérieur d'un filtre disposé dans le deuxième compartiment hermétique et de chacune des cigarettes placées dans le troisième compartiment hermétique. ue.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>